# Cedar+Slate website

## What this repo is

- Public **online presence** for Cedar+Slate (Australian software studio).
- Static HTML/CSS/JS plus one Cloudflare Pages Function at `functions/api/contact.js`.
- Not a marketing funnel: no campaigns, promo clutter, phone numbers, or street address on presence pages.
- No package manager, bundler, database, or CI unless explicitly introduced.

## Presence and design

- Keep the landing page as **one clean composition**. Prefer a single tidy page in an Apple-like software style: spare, calm, high clarity.
- **Headline must remain:** Thoughtful software, made with purpose.
- **Tagline must remain:** Cedar+Slate is an independent Australian studio creating useful, beautifully considered software.
- Preserve current colour direction unless asked to change it: charcoal `#3d3d3d`, orange `#f15a00`, paper `#f0efee`; logo at `/assets/cedar-slate.svg`.
- Contact may collect an optional phone number (default `+61`). Do not add postal/street address to the landing page or contact UI. ABN and PO Box stay in `legal/**` only.

## Legal

- Treat `legal/**` as sensitive. Do not rewrite Privacy/Terms unless Paul explicitly requests legal edits.

## Contact API

- Preserve: JSON POST, honeypot (`company`), origin allowlist for production hosts, timing check, HTML escaping, Resend from/to addresses unless asked to change them.
- Production origins allowed: `https://cedarslate.com.au` and `https://www.cedarslate.com.au`.
- Secrets (`RESEND_API_KEY`) live only in Cloudflare Pages env — never commit them.
- Turnstile was intentionally removed; do not reintroduce third-party widgets without asking.

## Workflow

- Feature branches; PR into `main`; Cloudflare Pages deploys from `main`.
- Prefer tiny, focused diffs. Match existing inline-CSS / single-file HTML patterns unless asked to refactor.
- Do not add frameworks or dependencies without an explicit request.
- Propose non-trivial changes and wait for approval when Paul has asked for suggest-then-approve.
